MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Kai_001: 妈妈……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Dit: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Dit_001: ……呵呵，\n哈哈哈，哈哈哈哈哈……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Seo_001: ……\n我们的恨……绝不会，消散……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Led_001: ……\n我……究竟是，为了什么……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Lin: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Lin_001: 怎……么……会……？
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_04_Gol: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_04_Gol_001: 这、这不可能……\n俺居然……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_05_Zac: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_05_Zac_001: 本大爷……居然……输了！？\n被、被这群货色……？
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_06_Ven: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_06_Ven_001: ……老夫……成为大将军的梦想……\n怎、怎么能放弃……还没结束……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_07_Nuz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_07_Nuz_001: 不会吧……\n我竟然输了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Ini: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Ini_001: ……不……不是吧。\n拥有这把弓的我……应该是无敌的……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Kou: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Kou_001: ……可恶，\n拉苦裟大人……我很抱歉……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Led_001: 不是……吧……？\n我居然……？
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Buc: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Buc_001: 到此为止了吗……\n很……遗憾……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_11_Znz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_11_Znz_001: 可、可恶……谁给你的这种权利\n做这么过分的事……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_12_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_12_Seo_001: 我……就这样输了吗？\n不，还没有……
MID_EV_DIE_BD11_12_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_BD11_12_Seo_001: 我……\n一定要为了……萨拉弥斯的……夙愿……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Har: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Har_001: 明……明明……\n还差一点就能……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Ger: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Ger_001: 不、不要啊……\n我已经不想再回牢房了……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas_001: ……身体、已经动不了了。\n似乎……有点太乱来了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas_Kai_001: 凯伊……真是的，\n居然变得这么厉害……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Bel_001: 居然能打倒我……\n挺……厉害的……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_01_Sem: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_01_Sem_001: 吼──────！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Anh: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Anh_001: 呃……！\n但是……我还能战斗……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Sar: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Sar_001: 糟了……\n我居然……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Naz: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Naz_001: 可恶……给我记住，\n下次我绝对不会输的……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Dai: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Dai_001: 哦哦，俺居然被干掉了！？\n你们这些家伙，不一般啊！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Hal: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Hal_001: 啊哇哇哇哇……\n我不行了，救救我！哎呀呀！
MID_EV_DIE_BD12_04_Maj: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_BD12_04_Maj_001: 不、会……吧……？\n马吉迪大爷我居然被……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_09_Ale: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_09_Ale_001: 真……\n真……真厉害……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Hri: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Hri_001: 不会吧，我竟然会失败……\n……真是厉害的家伙……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Nat: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Nat_001: 竟然接下了我的全力攻击……\n厉害……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_12_Ket: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_12_Ket_001: 噢噢————\n……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Conlon: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Conlon_001: 呀啊啊啊！
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Zen: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Zen_001: 嘎……啊……\n大家……对不住了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_15_Anh: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_15_Anh_001: 怎……怎么可能！？\n身为调停者的我居然……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_16_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_16_Bel_001: 居然能打倒我……\n挺……厉害的……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_Mar: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_Mar_001: ……原来如此，以人类来说确实有点本事……！\n真不愧是大赛优胜者——！
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_MarD: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_MarD_001: ……厉害。\n但这样还不足以打倒我……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_00_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_00_Baa_001: 女人……你的脸，和那只手臂……\n我，不会忘记的……
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_01_Hoo: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_01_Hoo_001: 赛奥朵拉殿下……\n真是……好身法……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_01_Day: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_01_Day_001: 你、你这家伙……\n竟敢让我……颜面尽失……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_04_MysteryMan: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_04_MysteryMan_001: 可恶的家伙……但是，\n只是这点程度可阻止不了我……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_BD13_05_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_BD13_05_Baa_001: 噫噫噫……\n噫噫噫噫噫……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_07_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_07_Baa_001: 就算……肉体消亡了……\n我的……灵魂也不会……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_09_Nuz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_09_Nuz_001: 对我们来说……\n安居之地什么的……已成幻影……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_13_Day: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_13_Day_001: 一而再，再而三……！\n又落入你们手里了，真是……屈辱……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_13_Kra: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_13_Kra_001: 可恶，果然……那家伙对我们来说……\n简直就是瘟神啊……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_00_Bjo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_00_Bjo_001: 可……可恶啊……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_01_Bol: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_01_Bol_001: 怎……怎么可能……\n这种事竟发生在我身上……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_03_Oly: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_03_Oly_001: 可恶……真厉害啊。\n但是，这还没完呢！
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_06_Jas: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_06_Jas_001: 呃啊……\n是我输了吗……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Lec: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Lec_001: 可恶……要将本“疯狗”\n当傻子戏耍到什么程度……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Mra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Mra_001: ……还挺能干的嘛。\n好像有点小看你们了。
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Kai_001: 可恶……\n真是……不走运……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Buc: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Buc_001: 到此为止了吗……\n很……遗憾……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_13_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_13_Seo_001: 居然能够……\n让我双膝跪地……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Qui: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Qui_001: ……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Mra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Mra_001: 召唤冥界到现世，对身体消耗太大了。\n似乎是时候撤退了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_15_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_15_Bel_001: ……挺能打的嘛！\n但是，还没完呢……！
