MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Seo_001: 我的武艺、我的信念，\n必须能让勇士引以为傲才行……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Kai_001: 呜哇……！\n可恶，我还没……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Kai_002: 凯伊！\n对不住了……
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Dit_001: ……！到此为止了吗……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Dit_002: 迪托利希！\n对不住了……
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Led: <TH>
