MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Orh: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Orh_001: 啊啊，索雷尔……\n明明就差一点点……
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Kai_001: 呜哇……！\n外婆的戒指……
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Kai_002: “外婆”……？\n那，你该不会是！
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Dit_001: ……！到此为止了吗……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Dit_002: 迪托利希先生……！\n怎么会，都怪我……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Seo: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Seo_001: 啊……非常抱歉，幽·法丝大人……\n还有，欧露赫露……
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Seo_002: 赛奥朵拉小姐……！\n你无须道歉……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Led: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Led_001: 骗人的吧……\n我居然会被……
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Led_002: 蕾达小姐……！\n怎么会，都怪我……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Bel: 
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Bel_001: 
