MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Anh: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Anh_001: 绝对不能死……\n要是我在这里倒下了，谁来保护大家……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Kai_001: 呜哇……！\n可恶，我还没……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Kai_002: 凯伊！\n对不起……
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Dit_001: ……！到此为止了吗……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Dit_002: 迪托利希！\n对不起……
